                    138.0,
                    596.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "– Confidentiality: encryption → secretion; encryption is applied. The entity creates the message and encrypts a single binary field of the XML message. The receiver decrypts that binary field.",
            "block_bbox": [
